<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 18.11 to 8020.77.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 2.28 to 482.96.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.21.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 1582 to 1290.</p>
<p>Volume was 629,057,170 compared with 646,000,310 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
